{"text":{"en":{"구면(스페리컬) 롤러 베어링 | [회사명] 베어링":"Spherical Roller Bearings | [Company Name] Bearing","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Spherical Roller Bearings</p> <h2>구면(스페리컬) 롤러 베어링</h2> <p>나무술통(Barrel) 모양의 롤러 2열을 조립한 내륜 베어링 중심과 외륜의 곡률 중심이 일치하는 형태입니다.</p> <p>하우징의 휨이 있는 경우와 축의 중심이 일치하지 않는 경우에 자동으로 조정되는 자동조심 능력이 있으며, 경방향 하중이 크고 충격하중이 작용하는 용도에 적합합니다.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">형번 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Spherical Roller Bearings</p> <h2>Spherical Roller Bearings</h2> <p>A type in which two rows of barrel-shaped rollers are assembled so that the center of curvature of the inner ring raceway and the outer ring coincide.</p> <p>It has self-aligning capability that automatically adjusts for housing deflection or shaft misalignment, and is suitable for applications with large radial loads combined with shock loads.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">You can search by entering just part of the model number or dimensions.</p>","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">당사 SWS 카탈로그 규격 도면</p> <img src=\"img/spherical_roller.png\" alt=\"구조 단면도\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d(내경) · D(외경) · 공차(d/D) · B(폭)</p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">Our SWS Catalog Standard Drawing</p> <img src=\"img/spherical_roller.png\" alt=\"Structure cross-section diagram\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d(Bore) · D(Outer Diameter) · Tolerance(d/D) · B(Width)</p>","<label for=\"sprFilter\">형번 / 규격 검색</label> <input id=\"sprFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: 22210 또는 50*90\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"sprFilter\">Model / Spec Search</label> <input id=\"sprFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. 22210 or 50*90\" autocomplete=\"off\">","<p class=\"finder-tip\" id=\"sprCount\" style=\"margin: 0;\"></p> <button type=\"button\" class=\"spec-toolbar-btn\" id=\"sprToggleAll\">전체 펼치기</button>":"<p class=\"finder-tip\" id=\"sprCount\" style=\"margin: 0;\"></p> <button type=\"button\" class=\"spec-toolbar-btn\" id=\"sprToggleAll\">Expand All</button>","222 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">29건</span>":"Series 222<span class=\"series-count\">29 items</span>","213 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">16건</span>":"Series 213<span class=\"series-count\">16 items</span>","223 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">24건</span>":"Series 223<span class=\"series-count\">24 items</span>","232 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">15건</span>":"Series 232<span class=\"series-count\">15 items</span>","231 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">14건</span>":"Series 231<span class=\"series-count\">14 items</span>","230 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">13건</span>":"Series 230<span class=\"series-count\">13 items</span>","241 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">13건</span>":"Series 241<span class=\"series-count\">13 items</span>","240 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">12건</span>":"Series 240<span class=\"series-count\">12 items</span>","233 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">2건</span>":"Series 233<span class=\"series-count\">2 items</span>","239 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">9건</span>":"Series 239<span class=\"series-count\">9 items</span>"},"ja":{"구면(스페리컬) 롤러 베어링 | [회사명] 베어링":"自動調心ころ軸受 | [会社名] ベアリング","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Spherical Roller Bearings</p> <h2>구면(스페리컬) 롤러 베어링</h2> <p>나무술통(Barrel) 모양의 롤러 2열을 조립한 내륜 베어링 중심과 외륜의 곡률 중심이 일치하는 형태입니다.</p> <p>하우징의 휨이 있는 경우와 축의 중심이 일치하지 않는 경우에 자동으로 조정되는 자동조심 능력이 있으며, 경방향 하중이 크고 충격하중이 작용하는 용도에 적합합니다.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">형번 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Spherical Roller Bearings</p> <h2>自動調心ころ軸受</h2> <p>樽(バレル)形のころ2列を組み付けた内輪の中心と外輪の曲率中心が一致する形式です。</p> <p>ハウジングにたわみがある場合や軸の中心が一致しない場合でも自動的に調整される自動調心能力があり、ラジアル荷重が大きく衝撃荷重が作用する用途に適しています。</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">形番または寸法の一部のみ入力しても検索できます。</p>","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">당사 SWS 카탈로그 규격 도면</p> <img src=\"img/spherical_roller.png\" alt=\"구조 단면도\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d(내경) · D(외경) · 공차(d/D) · B(폭)</p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">当社SWSカタログ規格図面</p> <img src=\"img/spherical_roller.png\" alt=\"構造断面図\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d(内径) ・ D(外径) ・ 公差(d/D) ・ B(幅)</p>","<label for=\"sprFilter\">형번 / 규격 검색</label> <input id=\"sprFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: 22210 또는 50*90\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"sprFilter\">形番 / 規格検索</label> <input id=\"sprFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"例: 22210 または 50*90\" autocomplete=\"off\">","<p class=\"finder-tip\" id=\"sprCount\" style=\"margin: 0;\"></p> <button type=\"button\" class=\"spec-toolbar-btn\" id=\"sprToggleAll\">전체 펼치기</button>":"<p class=\"finder-tip\" id=\"sprCount\" style=\"margin: 0;\"></p> <button type=\"button\" class=\"spec-toolbar-btn\" id=\"sprToggleAll\">すべて展開</button>","222 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">29건</span>":"222シリーズ<span class=\"series-count\">29件</span>","213 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">16건</span>":"213シリーズ<span class=\"series-count\">16件</span>","223 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">24건</span>":"223シリーズ<span class=\"series-count\">24件</span>","232 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">15건</span>":"232シリーズ<span class=\"series-count\">15件</span>","231 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">14건</span>":"231シリーズ<span class=\"series-count\">14件</span>","230 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">13건</span>":"230シリーズ<span class=\"series-count\">13件</span>","241 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">13건</span>":"241シリーズ<span class=\"series-count\">13件</span>","240 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">12건</span>":"240シリーズ<span class